  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Vehicle Application Advice Transaction Set (126) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set can be used by the vehicle manufacturer to notify a carrier as to the result of processing the transactions received from the carrier during the previous day or payments being released today or both.",
